  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting gender equality &amp; women enpowerment in higher leaning institutions in TZ</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall goal of the GATE programme is to establish institutional collaboration partnership, which will facilitate capacity building and development of a Centre for Excellence on Gender Equality and Women Empowerment in Higher Learning Institutions in Tanzania. TCD is the lead institution and our funding will enable them to collaborate with DUCE to train a new generation of experts, academic staff and students in Gender and Education.</narrative>
  </description>
